  "description": "\"You are the empress I choose,\" said the king who married me 6 years ago. True, the husband who was not in the wedding ceremony had to fight. For 6 years I never saw him and had to live in the palace with my mother-in-law who kept insulting me. When the king returns, I must prove that I am not a useless empress. My king, let me continue to spend these nights with you.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/51072932), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/4132000226), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=5685371), [Comico](https://www.comico.kr/comic/3615)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Indonesian](https://id.kakaowebtoon.com/content/Malam-Bersamamu/427)",
